<title>USA: Vencor says 19.8 mln TheraTx shares tendered.</title>
<headline>Vencor says 19.8 mln TheraTx shares tendered.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor Inc said Monday it had received 19,786,299 shares of TheraTx Inc, or about 95 percent of those outstanding, in response to its tender offer, and it has extended the offer to 1200 EST/1700 GMT on Tuesday, March 18, 1997, unless further extended.</p>
<p>Vencor said it made the extension in order to receive all of the necessary approvals under change of ownership, healthcare licensure and certificate of need laws and regulations.</p>
